# Striatum Gemini Extension (v{striatum_version})

This file is loaded as Gemini CLI's context when the Striatum
extension is active.

## Driving a Striatum workflow

1. Register a session for a (role, lane) pair.
2. Claim the next ready packet via `striatum claim-next`.
3. Ack the lease, do the work, publish the artifact, complete.

## Skills

- `skills/striatum-workflow/SKILL.md` — workflow scaffolding
- `skills/striatum-scaffold/SKILL.md` — repo init flow
- `skills/striatum-claim-loop/SKILL.md` — claim → ack → publish
- `skills/striatum-supervise/SKILL.md` — long-lived agent CLI
- `skills/striatum-recover/SKILL.md` — recovery / stale lease
- `skills/striatum-mcp/SKILL.md` — daemon MCP mutation guidance

